step s3pu: EXPLAIN (COSTS OFF) UPDATE gt SET x = x + gb.v FROM ga, gb WHERE gb.ga_id = ga.id AND gt.gb_id = gb.id AND ga.w = 1;
QUERY PLAN                                   
---------------------------------------------
Update on gt                                 
  ->  Nested Loop                            
        ->  Nested Loop                      
              Join Filter: (ga.id = gb.ga_id)
              ->  Seq Scan on ga             
                    Filter: (w = 1)          
              ->  Seq Scan on gb             
        ->  Index Scan using gt_gb on gt     
              Index Cond: (gb_id = gb.id)    
(9 rows)

